---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import TimeLineElement from "../components/cv/TimeLine.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Resume" sideBarActiveItemID="cv">
  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Profile</div>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-10 text-justify">
I am an Information Technology graduate with a specialization in web development and hands-on experience in building dynamic websites, mobile applications, and end-to-end systems. I have developed web applications using modern frameworks and tools such as Next.js, React-Bootstrap, Tailwind CSS, and CSS, and I have built cross-platform mobile apps using Flutter, Dart, and Firebase. On the backend, I’m proficient in PHP, JavaScript, Python, C# (.NET), and MySQL, enabling me to create robust and scalable systems. I also have foundational knowledge in network and system troubleshooting, allowing me to approach development with a well-rounded technical perspective. I’m eager to apply my skills and creativity to real-world challenges and contribute meaningfully to innovative, impactful projects.  
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Education</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container grid gap-4 mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
    
      title="Graduated"
      subtitle="[2021] to [2025] at [Phinma-Cagayan De Oro College], [Cagayan De Oro], [Philippines]"
    />

  </div>

